Content-Type: application/json

{"username":  "admin", "password":  "password"}

###
### get transaction status
GET localhost:8080/api/status/10

### create transaction

POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 35000,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "senderId": "sender20261",
  "receiverId": "receiver20261",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "transactionDate": "2026-02-08T07:50:00"
}

### get paginated transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions?page=2&size=5

### update transaction

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 12, "status": "COMPLETED" }